\section{Reproduction commands}
From \texttt{successors/memory\_v4}, use fresh output paths:
\begin{verbatim}
python3 -m unittest discover -s . -p 'test_*.py' -v
python3 experiment.py develop --output runs/development
python3 experiment.py verify --input runs/development \
  --output runs/development/verification-exact.json --replay
python3 experiment.py freeze --input runs/development \
  --output runs/freeze.json
python3 experiment.py confirm --lock runs/freeze.json \
  --output runs/confirmation
python3 experiment.py verify --input runs/confirmation \
  --output runs/confirmation/verification-exact.json --replay
python3 audit.py runs/confirmation runs/confirmation/audit.json
python3 experiment.py analyze --input runs/confirmation \
  --lock runs/freeze.json --output runs/analysis.json
python3 transfer.py run --dataset air --lock runs/freeze.json \
  --output runs/air-regression
python3 transfer.py run --dataset beijing --lock runs/freeze.json \
  --output runs/beijing-transfer
\end{verbatim}
Local runs additionally require 512 MiB reclaimable memory, a non-rising macOS pageout admission probe, process peak RSS below 512 MiB, numerical state at most 128 KiB, and a 1,800-second phase limit. Refusals create immutable receipts and no model attempts.

\section{Authorship, data, and ethics}
The report names Ryan Gomez, subject to owner verification before external submission. Implementation and drafting used AI assistance; this is not independent scientific review. No new human-subject data were collected. UCI provides the environmental datasets under their stated terms; exact downloaded file hashes and attribution are retained. No affiliation, venue acceptance, arXiv endorsement, production readiness, or external reproduction is claimed.

